[{"title":"次韵彝古鼎题报德方丈壁","author":"董纪","text":"老僧谈道席生风，纳得须弥芥子中。\n云磬响时经藏转，天花落处篆烟濛。\n上乘高妙无门入，正觉分明有路通。\n色本是空空是色，谁知非色也非空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，何须定在碧鸡坊。\n桑麻得雨饶生意，榆柳参天尽作行。\n居鹤另存閒地位，种鱼新凿小池塘。\n高情此外犹何慊，只少扁舟系岸傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55233,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，旁人错比百花庄。\n笔床茶灶皆新置，诗卷图书只旧藏。\n廛隐寄声求菊本，山僧折简送椒秧。\n豪华短促如春梦，不似田家饭力长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55234,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，野花山卉四时香。\n小儿学字涂鸦拙，奴子应门抵鹤长。\n自毁茶经高陆羽，不传琴散陋嵇康。\n太平朝野无遗佚，独为才疏得豹藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55235,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其四","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，石为阶砌土为墙。\n竹间棋局消长夏，树底胡床候晚凉。\n五月新丝登杼柚，四时佳果当糇粮。\n远游多少忘归客，日日邛崃与太行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55236,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其五","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，超然与世欲相忘。\n兴来得句追陶谢，閒去抄书补汉唐。\n东里花开时独往，南邻酒熟每先尝。\n浮生已是中年后，镜里何嫌鬓发苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55237,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其六","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，绿阴门巷麦风凉。\n缲车索索鸣中廇，烟火依依接近疆。\n溪女缬裙提瓮汲，邻翁挟俎隔田穰。\n熙熙实有先民乐，不比桃源事渺茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55238,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其七","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，时从野老话农桑。\n匏瓜足食何忧馑，檿柘新栽莫漫伤。\n架上法书兼魏晋，案閒诸子杂荀扬。\n朝耕夜读吾儒事，可不焚膏继夕光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55239,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其八","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，苍苔满径石田荒。\n灯前夜寂妻儿语，场下秋晴老弱忙。\n细纺木绵登市价，先砻䆉稏纳官仓。\n开门不见徵租吏，便是田家一小康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55240,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其九","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，槿花篱落几斜阳。\n过桥野色分江断，绕屋禽声得树藏。\n㭨子作杯倾绿醑，鲈鱼斫脍抹红姜。\n应门只为溪童懒，客至长令倒屣忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55241,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂杂兴十首 其十","author":"董纪","text":"我亦西郊有草堂，梅花纸帐竹筐床。\n茅柴味薄葱椒烈，榾柮烟消芋栗香。\n为着残棋知胜负，因观通鉴识兴亡。\n何须抵死忧身外，万事无如醉作乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送颙天际入南禅","author":"董纪","text":"结茅来住水云边，面壁工夫几岁年。\n已悟佛乘无小大，不知人事有推迁。\n江湖远迹应俱扫，雨露恩深岂独偏。\n井上辘轳移得去，钵盂到处濯清泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钱文规回凤阳","author":"董纪","text":"游子廿年来故乡，里闾访旧半存亡。\n买羊上冢逢寒食，骑鹤缠腰对艳阳。\n花信风高红雨急，濠梁水暖白鱼长。\n江南父老临门待，带得亲知字几行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明前二日林泉过予西郊留宿草堂晚步赋诗因次其韵","author":"董纪","text":"犬吠鸡鸣达四郊，依依烟火叠相交。\n时光暗转催农事，海味初来赡客庖。\n细柳绿欺临水树，小桃红傲出墙梢。\n子云寂寞甘衰朽，更有何心作解嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄章彦才","author":"董纪","text":"不见故人三十年，偶闻近况客谈边。\n生涯牢落身犹健，壮志蹉跎发已宣。\n昔日孩提今跨灶，暮年伉俪续调弦。\n旧游踪迹都如梦，觅纸题诗意惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵林泉留宿草堂感旧","author":"董纪","text":"时光物色易推迁，虚度青春五十年。\n昼夜本无閒日月，古今同是此风烟。\n伯鸾幸喜妻能敬，世绩惟忧子不贤。\n若问庞公身后事，遗安空有鹿门田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张伯英画","author":"董纪","text":"江山如画只依然，陈迹分明在眼前。\n茉莉花开还满路，荔枝树老又增年。\n岩中有客携家隐，马上何人衣锦还。\n信是闽乡文物盛，长歌短句锦连篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊庄为陈孟宣","author":"董纪","text":"茜水塘西第一家，竹篱茅屋枕鸥沙。\n数株画意婆娑柳，三径幽香隐逸花。\n彭泽郎官存故事，吴门老圃共生涯。\n从来因得延年力，晚节优游鬓未华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉吟四首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"俯仰视茫茫，天地如许大。\n不知有何物，更在天地外。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉吟四首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"日月相代明，西没复东出。\n昨夜又今朝，四序常不失。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉吟四首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"大海渺无垠，自非人力为。\n天作与地设，古有何人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉吟四首 其四","author":"董纪","text":"自从有天地，人事几迁改。\n更过百年期，今人谁复在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小山丛竹四首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"虽云覆篑功，崒嵂若天产。\n自怡道人心，不供俗子眼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小山丛竹四首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"有仙何必高，神会即嵩华。\n岷峨纵在前，当使入我跨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小山丛竹四首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"地偏人迹稀，林静鸟声乐。\n松留石上阴，竹解风前箨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小山丛竹四首 其四","author":"董纪","text":"去湿茱萸酒，扶衰枸杞茶。\n满山屯玉气，平地出丹砂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倪元镇画","author":"董纪","text":"地僻无人扫，亭前长绿苔。\n不知丁氏鹤，何日可归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹云西画","author":"董纪","text":"贞溪人如玉，诗画清无比。\n至今溪上人，不唾溪中水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾定之墨竹二首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"木脱百草枯，此君有贞节。\n独于岁寒时，居然傲霜雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾定之墨竹二首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"种竹何必多，无则令人俗。\n萧萧一两竿，清风自然足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵仲基春来杂思十首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"月在摄提格，天回甲子春。\n麻姑多寿算，几见海扬尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵仲基春来杂思十首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"溪艇瓜皮小，沙堤镜面光。\n梨花能雪白，柳色赛鹅黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵仲基春来杂思十首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"鹅眼穿榆荚，儿拳怒蕨芽。\n不知王谢燕，此日在谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵仲基春来杂思十首 其四","author":"董纪","text":"南风又北风，今日非昨日。\n草暗习家池，苔乾谢公屐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵仲基春来杂思十首 其五","author":"董纪","text":"好花容易褪，恶草自然生。\n我亦徙憎爱，无情对有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵仲基春来杂思十首 其六","author":"董纪","text":"杨柳低金缕，鸬鹚滟玉蛆。\n纵无山简马，也伴倒骑驴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry"