":"明"}},{"title":"雪煮茶三首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"梅雪轩中雪煮茶，倚阑和雪看梅花。\n新年第一逢清赏，当作人间胜事誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪煮茶三首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"梅雪轩中雪煮茶，无人知此淡生涯。\n肩舆迎送劳烦主，比似山阴兴不赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捕鱼图","author":"董纪","text":"道士矶头春雨晴，桃花水涨柳风轻。\n妻孥不缺鱼羹饭，何必人间利与名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人镜中影","author":"董纪","text":"画中元是镜中人，看画何如览镜亲。\n若使果然能解语，便于纸上唤真真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫让","author":"董纪","text":"生不匡君死报君，赵襄未害杀忠臣。\n头非自漆谁能漆，愧尔何劳更漆身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宋太祖雪夜幸赵普第","author":"董纪","text":"风雪开门夜甚寒，此来非但一尊欢。\n江南果是他家物，岂可容人卧侧鼾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东坡赤壁图","author":"董纪","text":"月明风细水无波，客有吹箫自倚歌。\n东望武昌西夏口，山川如此感怀多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子猷访戴","author":"董纪","text":"雪夜乘舟意似痴，一时狂态竟谁知。\n非关兴尽空归去，自觉无由见戴逵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒情二首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"酒滟珍珠白玉缸，多情蛱蝶小红窗。\n深深各出穿花去，还复飞来各一双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒情二首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"暑渴消时酒半醒，自调冰水贮银瓶。\n夕阳又带梧桐影，过到窗间第二棂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉士女二首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"惜春情重减香肌，正及提孩学步时。\n莫道芭蕉通换叶，已无一笔旧题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉士女二首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"春来心事恐人知，懒写芭蕉叶上诗。\n记得霓裳新乐谱，晚凉偷按玉参差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵俞原举雪中见寄五首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"草堂真率更无加，悬榻待君能几家。\n梅雪轩中春有约，莫教孤负海棠花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵俞原举雪中见寄五首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"摇落空山无茂林，仅馀松柏岁寒心。\n洛阳闻扫城中雪，只有袁安住处深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵俞原举雪中见寄五首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"雪绕鸳湖景绝尘，王恭鹤氅倍风神。\n此时为子遥相忆，欲作山阴访戴人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵俞原举雪中见寄五首 其四","author":"董纪","text":"西郊风雪满天时，坐隐乌皮独尔思。\n书札未来先得喜，鹊声偏在傍檐枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵俞原举雪中见寄五首 其五","author":"董纪","text":"过雁无凭望欲迷，春波只隔五茸西。\n相思此夜何终极，月在青天水在溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"董纪","text":"金鸭香残犹有烬，银台烛灭仅留心。\n夜深月到蔷薇架，斜送窗间一角阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效秦文仲绝句四首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"文渊阁下随朝士，右顺门西待诏人。\n中使口传銮驾出，各将封事御前陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55298,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效秦文仲绝句四首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"日上东华暖雾开，御河金水碧于苔。\n内廷擎出青凉伞，知是黄门进膳来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55299,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效秦文仲绝句四首 其三","author":"董纪","text":"朱衣绣袄织金花，宝盖仙幢拥翠华。\n文武班齐天乐奏，龙头小辇载官家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55300,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"效秦文仲绝句四首 其四","author":"董纪","text":"百官朝罢乘舆还，阶下龙媒立仗间。\n燕避罘罳风不动，黄金宫阙五云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55301,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵怀古","author":"董纪","text":"桥逢朱雀题无柱，巷入乌衣住有人。\n野老不知前代事，却嫌过客问梁陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55302,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早发安庆喜得顺风","author":"董纪","text":"船头奔浪响潺潺，雪捲云翻汹涌间。\n只恐好风帆去疾，匆匆过却小孤山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55303,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵濂溪先生题罗天岩诗","author":"董纪","text":"咫尺仙岩不可寻，甘棠何处閟清阴。\n洞门只在烟萝里，无路攀缘枉费心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55304,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过郎当岭","author":"董纪","text":"郎当岭外分司马，惶恐滩头奉使船。\n到处不如归去好，南窗寄傲北窗眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55305,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张林泉兄弟倡和三首 其一","author":"董纪","text":"一车南去两帆西，白首林泉独短藜。\n为问闽中听谢豹，何如清夜楚猿啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张林泉兄弟倡和三首 其二","author":"董纪","text":"友于情重尺书稀，各向西风怨落晖。\n肠断几声嘹呖雁，如何不作一行飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":55307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]